    old "She's always been my anchor. The one person I could count on when everything else fell apart."
    new "Ela sempre foi minha âncora. A única pessoa com quem eu podia contar quando tudo desmoronava."

    old "Now she's out there, standing her ground—fighting for what she wants. So... her."
